# Rust
# native/Cargo.lock IS tracked (not ignored): it pins the exact dependency
# versions the published native library is compiled from, for reproducible
# builds, same as bdk-dart's native/Cargo.lock.
native/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Flutter/Dart
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
pubspec.lock

# Native libs built locally
*.dylib
*.so
*.dll
